# Btop theme: Solitude (dark, cool grays with a single orange-red accent)
# Palette: bg #101315, fg #cacccc, bright fg #d9dbdc, slate #798186, light gray #9fa5a9,
#          steel #5d6367, graphite #343d41, warm #cbc2be, hot #de6145

